SY_TALK("MjauXfkYrag",[[3,["I bow to all the seekers of Truth."]],[10,["I want to wish you Happy Holi today. It's","a very joyous day for all of us"]],[16,["and I have told you about Vishuddhi","chakra yesterday, where resides","Shri Krishna"]],[22,["and why He started the festival of Holi."]],[28,["As I told you before, this is the","knowledge of the roots"]],[32,["while whatever knowledge we have in","the colleges, Medical College,"]],[40,["Colleges of Psychology and Other","Sciences, which deal with"]],[45,["human-beings on Scientific Research","and Scientific Datas, is the knowledge","of the tree."]],[54,["So to become the knowledge of the","roots, we have to become","subtler people."]],[63,["With human awareness we cannot","dive down into ourselves."]],[69,["For example, you are all paying","attention to Me but if I say that,"]],[74,["take your attention inside,","you cannot take it."]],[77,["You'll say, \"How to do it? It doesn't go","inside.\" Our attention is spread outside","- that is how we are made."]],[83,["Specially, that we should put our","attention outside and understand","the value of our feedom."]],[93,["As human-beings we are free to","choose right and wrong."]],[100,["We have through traditions developed","lot of correct ideas about right","and wrong"]],[108,["but there have been lots of saints","and seers who have given us"]],[116,["a complete idea about what is right","and what is wrong."]],[122,["Despite that, we find it difficult to be","righteous, to be virtuous, to be what","that we believe in."]],[134,["We see something, we hear something,","we know something, that it is good","that we should be like that,"]],[141,["but we just can't do it. We're not","'samarth', we're not capable of doing","what we believe."]],[151,["The reason for this is because we are","not integrated personalities."]],[159,["Our brain says something, our heart","says another thing and our liver","does another thing."]],[165,["So we are divided into three, four","personalities and that's why we","cannot integrate ourselves."]],[173,["To integrate ourselves, we have to","become something that is integrated","within ourselves."]],[180,["Now this integrated self is the Spirit.","The Spirit resides in the heart."]],[189,["It is said by all the seers but in Sahaja","yoga, now we can prove it that it","does reside."]],[195,["That is, God Almighty reflects Himself","in the heart, as Spirit."]],[201,["And the Spirit is the One, which is","watching us all the time."]],[208,["The Spirit does not manifest in our","attention. If it starts manifesting"]],[213,["in our attention, then we start feeling","on our Central Nervous System,"]],[220,["the coolness of the Spirit, the vibrations","of the Spirit, the manifestation","of the Spirit."]],[227,["But when it does not manifest, it keeps","out and watches us as a Saakshi."]],[233,["Now, this Spirit is the One, that is","the integrated point."]],[239,["Once we become the Spirit all these","beings that are within us"]],[243,["which are disintegrated become","completely integrated"]],[247,["and that's how we become capable of","doing what we believe good or right"]],[255,["through our mind, through our efforts","and through our love."]],[262,["It all combines together and we do","perform everything that has complete","integrated expression."]],[273,["Now to become the Spirit, people have","said that you have to meditate, you","have to go inside"]],[281,["because at the time of Shri Krishna,","He could not talk on these level"]],[286,["that people were not so well-equipped","to understand it."]],[291,["Now how to meditate,","is again the problem."]],[293,["If I say, you have to go inside to","meditate, you'll say how to go inside?"]],[299,["Now, we have to understand, God","Almighty has made us very beautifully."]],[305,["We never ask the question once, \"Why","has He made us a human-being?\""]],[310,["\"Why did we go through the complete","process of evolution to become","a human-being?\""]],[315,["Now we have become a human-being","but why, why are we human-being?"]],[320,["And if human-beings are the epitome","of evolution,"]],[325,["then why there are problems, why","we are not integrated?"]],[329,["So, we have to jump a little higher","stage, a little higher awareness"]],[336,["by which we start understanding","the Absolute nature."]],[340,["Just now we are living on absolutely","relative terminology."]],[345,["Everything is relative. You don't know","whether this is good or bad, whether","this should be done or not?"]],[350,["But for a self-realized person there is","no doubt because he knows"]],[355,["that his Spirit is emitting those","vibrations, which are all the time flowing"]],[362,["and if he tries to do something wrong,","they immediately stop."]],[367,["So, like a computer he gets attached or","you can say, united with the Divine"]],[374,["and then the computer starts working","and informing that this is not right","and that is not right."]],[382,["It's a very wonderful computer that God","has created; We are one of the most","exceptional type of computers."]],[392,["We have computers in the world that","human-beings have created"]],[396,["it has to go through the thinking","power and then come to something"]],[400,["and the thinking is also fed into it by","another thinking one, who has thought","from a very limited energy."]],[407,["But we do not think and we see. I see","you without thinking, I can see","you without thinking."]],[415,["As soon as I see you, I know who","you are but for a computer,"]],[420,["it has to go through the process of","finding out who the person is."]],[425,["Now, there's a big challenge now facing","us that people are taking to artificial","methods in every field of life"]],[434,["because they have not been able to go","higher than what they are,"]],[440,["because they have missed their ascent,","they're taking to all kinds of artificial","things."]],[445,["First of all they are taking to artificial","things like computers."]],[450,["Now these computers could be very","dangerous because the matter is all the","time trying to overpower the Spirit."]],[459,["When you are creating a machine, you","don't know how much you are going in","the clutches of the machinery."]],[465,["That the machine one day, if you do","not allow and assert your freedom"]],[471,["and a proportionate understanding of","the powers of machine also,"]],[476,["you might just be finished","completely."]],[480,["You can see that these computers","now can speak, can take over."]],[484,["Supposing something goes wrong with","the computer, it can start devouring"]],[489,["the whole world - how can you stop it?","Because, it's a machine, it's the matter"]],[494,["which is, which doesn't understand - it","is innocent. It doesn't understand","whether it is constructing or destroying."]],[501,["So, this is a very dangerous point where","we have arrived. In every field we are","doing such dangerous things."]],[508,["Like in the agricultural side we can see","that we try to make a hybrid seed;"]],[516,["Hybrid seed can never produce seeds.","Moreover the all this hybrid business","gives problems."]],[523,["If you study a hybrid cow and an","ordinary cow, you'll be amazed"]],[527,["that the hybrid cow has no sensitivity","to her child."]],[533,["If she, if a calf dies of a simple cow, she","stops giving milk, she stops giving milk"]],[541,["because her love informs her that the","child is no more - what is the use of","giving milk now, for whom?"]],[547,["But if a hybrid cow's calf dies,","this doesn't bother her."]],[553,["You see the little hen that we have","in the villages - because people have","now studied them very well -"]],[559,["they say, a hen, which is an ordinary","hen, which is a normal hen,"]],[564,["if it sees the little chicks around","it and when the, she sees the"]],[569,["some sort of an attack from some birds","or something, she immediately calls her"]],[576,["little chicks and puts her, her complete","protection for them."]],[583,["But if you have somebody, say a,","somebody which is a hybrid one"]],[592,["like the incubator or something - they","have no feeling for their children,"]],[597,["they have no feeling for them, so even if","some rat is coming - anything -"]],[600,["she is not bothered - let somebody eat","the children, do what they like."]],[605,["It is so much going into our lives that","we are not aware as to how much we","are dominated by the matter."]],[612,["Matter is a very important thing but it is","to be seen what it does to the Spirit."]],[622,["Now for example, what we do of matter,","is nothing but to change it's forms."]],[627,["We develop an ego thinking, 'We have","done this, we have done that,"]],[631,["we have built this big thing and we have","huge, big palaces built by us.\""]],[637,["But what are all these things - are","nothing but stones - from dead","to the dead."]],[642,["What have you achieved? Nothing but","an ego, which is absolutely"]],[646,["- ego means something you believe","into which does not exist."]],[649,["So you believe into something that is","the matter, that you have changed the","forms of the matter"]],[657,["but as a result what happens, you","become a slave of the matter."]],[660,["For example, those who are used to the","chair, cannot sit on the ground."]],[664,["You get used to it, you form habits and","this matter starts dominating you","all the time."]],[670,["When the whole ideology in the West","starts with the individual growth"]],[675,["and also of the comfort - comfort is a","very important thing in the","Western philosophy"]],[680,["that you must achieve comfort and","when you start seeking the comfort"]],[684,["of the body, what happens, that your","body becomes such a slave"]],[688,["of the material things that you are","absolutely flabbergasted"]],[694,["the way you land into a very","funny situation."]],[697,["For example in England, now I'm there, I","find it is impossible to get fresh chicken,"]],[703,["is impossible to get fresh lamb,","everything is tinned and you","cannot change"]],[709,["because it has gone into that kind of a","big industry, industralized process"]],[717,["that if you want to have anything","that is simple, that is natural,"]],[722,["you just can't get it. You have to do the","way it is done for the whole there and","that's what you have to accept."]],[729,["While in India, thank God, we are not","that mad, that we still can get lots","of things which are fresh."]],[735,["But the greatest thing we can get in","this world is the love, love of","other people."]],[741,["Holi is one of the festivals in which we","express our love to all the people."]],[746,["Now, in England if you go or in any","other Western countries,"]],[750,["the love is expressed through a printed","card, where we say, \"We wish you a","happy Christmas,\" - finished."]],[755,["To their father also they send a card,","\"We wish you a happy Christmas.\""]],[759,["You go to the market, get some papers,","write down or they might get","readymade everything."]],[766,["You get readymade for the mother,","readymade for the father,"]],[768,["readymade for the grandfather,","readymade for everything."]],[771,["Just bring the readymade stuff and","write it down and send it over."]],[774,["I've seen sometimes people make","mistakes and they might send a, one of"]],[782,["these readymade ones in such a funny","way, that instead of addressing"]],[786,["to the child, they may address it","to the grandmother."]],[789,["So, it is so much of a mechanized life","that you have lost that flexibility,"]],[798,["that can really inspire love within","our hearts."]],[802,["Such people become absolutely dry,","they have no love for anybody"]],[807,["and what they want is only material","things. This matter cannot give you joy,"]],[813,["is already said in the Economics, if you","see, the law of Economics, the first","and the foremost is,"]],[819,["that 'A want is satiable in particular","but not in general.'"]],[828,["Means, nothing can satisfy your wants.","You will today asked say for a bicycle,"]],[834,["tomorrow for a car, then for a house,","then for an aeroplane - I don't","know how it goes."]],[840,["So a person is never satisfied, who tries","to find joy in material things."]],[847,["So now, we come to the point where we","see that these Western countries, as","I had mentioned to you earlier"]],[854,["the three affluent countries like","Sweden, Norway and Switzerland"]],[858,["are competing among themselves, as to","the rate of suicidal tendencies and","how many people suicide."]],[865,["Now of course, this year they have given","prize to Switzerland because"]],[869,["they have the greatest number of","people, young people who are","committing suicide."]],[873,["So they have the highest income.","Despite that they are committing","suicide"]],[877,["because they have not found the joy.","They have done everything."]],[881,["They have got beautiful Railways, they","have got beautiful telephones - not","like Delhi telephones"]],[886,["and they have got everything first class.","Despite all that they have now decided"]],[892,["that most of the young people should","commit suicide - that's the only","way they can exist."]],[897,["That suggests one thing definitely,","that their movement towards the"]],[902,["achievement of material well-being has","not given them anything of substantial","value."]],[911,["So now they are turning to God, turning","to Spirit, trying to find out what should","they do to become the Spirit."]],[920,["Now we must know those people have","talked of the Spirit didn't tell lies."]],[924,["They didn't tell us lies - that is","first thing we must know."]],[927,["There are some people who say, \"We","don't believe in God,\" - I think is a","sign of complete arrogance,"]],[932,["is a sign of ignorance also that you","just say, \"I don't believe in God.\""]],[940,["Is like a person who goes to a University","or school and there he goes and","tells his teacher,"]],[947,["\"I don't believe in this that this","can happen.\""]],[950,["If you are sensible and balanced person","and wise, then you can think it over,"]],[959,["that why is it in the world today","there's a moral crisis, why we are","suffering so much?"]],[965,["The reason is, we have given too much","importance to the material living."]],[970,["Too much importance. The material life","also cannot be a enjoyed without the","Spiritual life."]],[976,["Now, I'll tell you what happens when the","Kundalini rises above the Agnya Chakra,"]],[981,["which is placed between the pitutary","and the pineal body in the","optic chiasma."]],[988,["The optic chiasma has got this very","important center."]],[995,["Now this important center cannot be","seen through a microscope or anything"]],[1001,["but it asserts and exerts this power","when you see the Kundalini rising."]],[1007,["When the Kundalini rises, mostly it","stops at that point, which we call","as the Agnya chakra."]],[1014,["You have seen now - yesterday you saw","so many people had this problem"]],[1019,["of their Kundalini stopping at the Nabhi","chakra or at the Agnya chakra."]],[1023,["You can see clearly when it stops at the","Nabhi chakra, with your naked eye","you can see the pulsation"]],[1028,["of the Kundalini that rises and goes and","stops at liver or some places."]],[1033,["but at the Agnya Chakra you","cannot see."]],[1036,["When it stops at Agnya Chakra, it","also drops down."]],[1039,["Now this Agnya chakra which is placed","between the pitutary and the pineal"]],[1044,["in the center of the optic chiasma, is","the one which is a very narrow gate,"]],[1051,["which is a very narrow gate through","which somebody had to pass through"]],[1057,["to prove that eternal life is to be sought."]],[1061,["Like Krishna has said about eternal life,","'Nainam chidanti shastrani, nainam","dehti pavaka,'"]],[1068,["'Nainam chidanti shastrani, nainam","dehti pavaka, na chainam ...."]],[1080,["na shosayeti marut.' You see the thing","is, 'Na kledyantiyapo na shosayeti","marut.'"]],[1087,["The reason is, what he's trying to say is,","this cannot be killed, this cannot be","destroyed, this cannot be sucked in.'"]],[1096,["What is that? That is the Spiritual life,","that is the Eternal life that is within us."]],[1101,["Now how do you do it? Where do you","get that eternal life which cannot be","crushed?"]],[1107,["If somebody had to show, what is that?"]],[1110,["Krishna has described it so clearly in","His lifetime that, 'You have to achieve","that eternal life, which I'm telling you.'"]],[1119,["So somebody had to come on this","earth, on this Agnya chakra to","work it out."]],[1123,["In that I would say, that you should go","and read some of these treatise"]],[1130,["about Mahavishnu, which is described","by Markandeya."]],[1136,["Markandeya is the person, who has very","clearly described the origin of","Mahavishnu."]],[1148,["Mahavishnu was created by Shri","Radhaji. Shri Radhaji is the Mahalaxmi,"]],[1154,["is the Sushumna, is the","Parasympathetic Nervous System","within ourselves."]],[1157,["She has created with Her own","will-power, this Mahavishnu."]],[1162,["And this one was like an egg and half of","it became active and became","Mahavishnu"]],[1170,["and with that active Mahavishnu we can","cross through the Agnya chakra."]],[1177,["As I told you before that we had ten","gurus who came on this earth"]],[1184,["and they represented the innocence of","the three, Brahma, Vishnu, Mahesha"]],[1190,["of Dattatreya and one of them was","Zoraster, another was","Mohammad Sahab"]],[1197,["and all these gurus represent those","qualities of innocence of these three","personalities, called as Dattatreya."]],[1206,["And also told you how by understanding","these different gurus, we can produce"]],[1214,["effects even on our physical health."]],[1217,["Like, we had a doctor who came all the","way from Iran and that day I was","very tired,"]],[1225,["very tired and I told him that 'You have","to become a Sikh gentleman, if you","want to become alright.'"]],[1235,["And, 'I cannot help you much because","you do not believe that there's","anybody else but Mohammad Sahab.'"]],[1241,["And he got very angry. I said, 'I'm really","very tired and in one sentence I want to","finish it because I'm really very tired.'"]],[1247,["So he went away and he came back","next day and started arguing."]],[1251,["He said, \"How do you, what do You","mean by this?\""]],[1253,["I said, \"I mean that Mohammad Sahab","and Gurunanak are the same","personalities.\""]],[1259,["He said, \"How do You say that?\"","I said it is said that"]],[1262,["once Gurunanaka was lying down and","people said that, \"Sir, your feet are","towards Mecca.\""]],[1269,["So He said, \"Alright, I'll turn this side.\"","He turned on the other side and","Mecca was on the other side."]],[1276,["What does that mean? That means that","Mecca is at the feet of Mohammad","Sahab,"]],[1281,["also at the feet of of Shri Gurunanaka.","That means both of them are the","same personalities."]],[1287,["And if you want to argue with Me, I","cannot tell you how but I will tell you"]],[1292,["one that, if you want to get cured of","your cancer of your stomach, then","you have to believe in Gurunanaka.'"]],[1301,["He said, \"I can't believe in Gurunanaka.\"","I said, \"I cannot cure you, I'm sorry,","I just can't help you.\""]],[1307,["He went home. His wife was a wiser","woman she said, \"My husband is","going to die now.\""]],[1311,["She said, \"Alright, why not believe in","Gurunanaka, let's see what happens.\""]],[1314,["So he came down after 3-4 days, when","he had very bad time and he said,"]],[1319,["\"Mother alright, now we would like","to know about Gurunanaka.\""]],[1321,["So I told him about the greatness of","Gurunanaka, why He came on this earth"]],[1326,["because He found that what","Mohammad Sahab had done, is undone","by Muslims"]],[1331,["so He came down to tell the Indians","about Mohammad Sahab and about"]],[1339,["other gurus and to bring a unity of","Hindu and Muslims."]],[1342,["But you can see now what's happening","to that also."]],[1345,["So the all whatever good these great","people have done, can be all"]],[1349,["neutralized by our own ideologies and","by adding to it our own biased","arguments."]],[1359,["And this is what happened with","all the, all the great gurus."]],[1364,["Now as I told you, that with the guru","problem you develop the stomach","trouble."]],[1370,["For example a person who's following","Dattatreya always will have a stomach","trouble, always will have"]],[1375,["and if you have to correct him, you have","to tell him how to take the name","of Dattatreya."]],[1381,["Now in the same way we know, that","Christ came on this earth and He was","the incarnation of Shri Ganesha Himself."]],[1393,["Shri Ganesha is a 'chir balaka', is a","eternal child and that's how He took","birth on this earth as Christ."]],[1400,["So when you see a cross, people","get frightened."]],[1404,["When they saw the cross in","Maharashtra, they said, \"O Mother,","are You preaching Christianity?\""]],[1410,["I said, \"Supposing the Swastika","becomes the cross, have you any","objection to that?\""]],[1415,["He said, \"Then we have no objection.\""]],[1417,["\"If Swastika becomes a cross,","we have no objection.\""]],[1419,["So Swastika, which represents Shri","Ganesha, who is the Carbon atom","within us with the four valencies,"]],[1428,["becomes the cross, when it comes","to the Sahastrara."]],[1432,["Because in between the Sahastrara, the","top chakra and the lower part of it,"]],[1438,["that is we can say, the Vishuddhi, there","is placed this special chakra called","the Agnya chakra."]],[1445,["And to enter into the Sahastrara,","which is the Kingdom of God,"]],[1449,["as it is described, the limbic area, one","has to pass through this narrow gate"]],[1453,["and something, which is absolutely","eternal, had to pass."]],[1457,["Now you know that Shri Ganesh is","Onkara, is the Brahmshakti, is the shakti","which we feel after realization,"]],[1464,["which you felt yesterday around you.","Now, this is the only thing that can pass"]],[1469,["through this one, a small gate, that's","why it is said, \"I'm the path, I'm the gate.\""]],[1475,["But He didn't say, \"I'm the door.\" But He","didn't say, \"I am the destination.\""]],[1479,["He didn't say, \"I am the destination,\" the","reason was, by saying that He would","have stopped the progress further."]],[1485,["And that's why He didn't say, \"I'm the","destination,\" because destination is","the limbic area."]],[1491,["Now it is very interesting to know how","people try to treat/trick everything."]],[1497,["For example in the life of Mohammad","Sahab, He himself has said,"]],[1500,["\"When the time of resurrection will","come, your hands will speak.\""]],[1504,["Very clearly He has said in the Koran.","He has written so much about the"]],[1508,["resurrection time, which is today, which","you are feeling in your hands, but","nobody talks about it."]],[1512,["They only talk about the Kayamat,","the time when everybody is going","to be destroyed."]],[1517,["They are just talking about that part,","that everybody is going to be destroyed"]],[1520,["and you should be frightened, you","should be awed, that you should come","to all these mullahs"]],[1525,["and pray to these mullahs and become","frightened people thinking that the","Kayamat is going to fall."]],[1532,["But there is a resurrection time in","between, which is described so clearly"]],[1536,["in Koran but is not mentioned at all","throughout, if you see,"]],[1540,["people never talk about it, people don't","know there iks a resurrection time."]],[1543,["Mohammad Sahab has very, very clearly","talked about it and said that,"]],[1547,["\"At that time your hands will speak.\"","He has called Kundalini as Aasas."]],[1552,["Now in the Bible also we have, \"I will","appear before you like tongues","of flames.\""]],[1557,["These chakras, these centres look like","tongues of flames."]],[1560,["Specially the Sahastrara is such a","beautiful assemblage of different color"]],[1564,["of flames, which are very mildly moving","and are living flames, you can see them."]],[1570,["If you cut the brain, in the transverse","section of a brain if you see,"]],[1574,["it looks like the petals of a lotus.","It is thousand petalled brain"]],[1580,["and you can see those thousand petals","enlightened, if you can achieve your","evolution to that point"]],[1586,["which just looks like a beautiful lotus","with flame like little, little petals,"]],[1595,["which are living petals and you can see","this silence and the beauty of those petals."]],[1602,["Through that, is in the center, is the","Agnya chakra, through which the","Kundalini has to pierce,"]],[1610,["which is a very difficult path and one","had to come on this earth to show what"]],[1617,["Krishna has said that, 'You have to","lead an eternal life.'"]],[1621,["That's why Christ incarnated, He was","MahaVishnu, He was specially made -"]],[1627,["that's why on the Easter day they make","an egg. If you ask a Christian man,"]],[1630,["\"Why do you make, give an egg on a","Easter day,\" they won't be able to","tell you."]],[1634,["But it is in the Purana of the League that","you can find out, that He was first","made like an egg."]],[1642,["Now human being also is an, like an egg","because when he is born, gradually"]],[1648,["his Pitutary starts working and he","collects lot of ego on top of his head."]],[1653,["So ego and superego, both of them","meet in the fontanel bone area"]],[1658,["and you develop a calcified brain here,","I mean, really a box and you become a","person with your I-ness."]],[1668,["Like, \"I'm Mr. So, Mrs. So, Like I'm a","citizen of this and I'm a Christian,","or a Hindu or I'm an Indian"]],[1678,["or Englishman.' All these, you see,","separate identities start crawling","into you"]],[1683,["and you become like a box or like an","egg. Now this egg has to grow."]],[1689,["When it is ready enough, then only, just","like we a call a Brahmin, a dwijah -"]],[1697,["a Brahmin who is not a dwijah, is called","abrahmin. In the shastras he is called as,"]],[1703,["a-brahmin - he's not a Brahmin, he's","a-brahmin. That 'a' has to go away"]],[1708,["till he gets his realization, he's still","a-brahmin. So when this breaks,","this egg breaks into a new being,"]],[1720,["when you become a new being, you're","called a dwijah and a bird is also","called a dwijah,"]],[1726,["means, twice born. But there are many","people I met, they said, \"We're","already twice born.\""]],[1731,["Is all self-certification, \"We're","twice born.\""]],[1733,["What do you mean by twice-born? You","cannot just give a certificate to yourself."]],[1738,["If you're twice-born, then what is the","speciality? What do you get as a","twice-born personality?"]],[1744,["First of all, you should become","collectively conscious - means on your","Central Nervous System."]],[1752,["Always, whatever you have evolved,","comes on your Central Nervous system."]],[1757,["But now after realization, on your","Central Nervous system you should feel"]],[1764,["your own centres, the subtle centres","and you should feel the centres of","others. That's the minimum"]],[1772,["that should happen to a person,","who says who's a yogi."]],[1775,["If he cannot say that, then he's just","giving him a certificate,"]],[1778,["like that, you can certify yourself that,","\"I'm the Prime Minister of India,\""]],[1781,["but who's going to listen to you? This","self-certification is a very easy thing,"]],[1787,["as far as God is concerned and the","religion is concerned because there is","no law that people think"]],[1792,["can really guide them or can put them","in the prison, so they do the","way they like."]],[1799,["Now we have to understand that there","is a life in this lifetime only -"]],[1807,["you're going to get a life which is in a","very different dimension,"]],[1813,["where your Spirit starts shining through","your attention, through your","Central Nervous System."]],[1820,["Yesterday many people felt the cool","breeze. Now what is this cool breeze?"]],[1824,["This cool breeze is the Onkar Shakti,","is the Brahm Shakti of God, the","All-Pervading Power of God."]],[1832,["The Power that converts or that","transforms a flower into a fruit."]],[1838,["Till you become a fruit, we do not","separate the fruit from the tree."]],[1842,["In the same way, till you become a","realized soul, you cannot have","that detachment."]],[1848,["Those people who work at detachment","before realization, are really trying to","do a very immature thing."]],[1855,["It doesn't work. Whence you are","matured enough, then only you can feel","the detachment completely"]],[1863,["and in that detachment you give, you","become dynamic."]],[1866,["Like the sap in the tree, it rises, rises","and give it's energy, nourishment,","to every leaf,"]],[1874,["to every branch, to every flower, to","every fruit and it returns back, it doesn't","get attached to anyone."]],[1881,["If anybody gets attached like that, we","can see in any tree - it does not -"]],[1886,["they're sensible because trees and","'pashu's' are in the 'pasha' of God"]],[1890,["so they are sensible thing - they","never get attached."]],[1892,["But supposing like human-beings, they","get attached to one flower or to","one fruit,"]],[1897,["the whole tree will die and that fruit","will also die."]],[1901,["But this is what we do not realize, when","we get attached to our children,"]],[1905,["get attached to one person or attached","to this and attached to that, attached","to material thing."]],[1911,["But this detachment is actually your","true nature, which just works out,","when you become the Spirit."]],[1917,["Now to become the Spirit, you have to","pass through this Agnya Chakra."]],[1921,["Now in Sahaja yoga we have found out","the best mantra for this is,"]],[1925,["that \"Mother, I forgive everyone.\" - is the","best mantra for this - 'Kshama, kshama'"]],[1932,["But Agnya chakra has got two petals -","one infront and one at the back."]],[1937,["This is all placed in a this way. Actually","we can say that the front side is here","and the back side is there."]],[1943,["But all this works out in such a manner","that when you have too much of ego"]],[1950,["when you have too much of ego, then","your one of the petals starts working,"]],[1959,["which we can say, that this","petal looks after the Pitutary."]],[1963,["So when you have ego, you think, 'I will","do this, I must do this, I plan out","this one,"]],[1967,["I must achieve this, ' and ambitious","people - we can say the Rajogunis."]],[1971,["The Rajogunis when they assert","themselves too much, they develop"]],[1975,["an ego on top of their heads, as I told","you and the another one, the ones","who deal"]],[1983,["with life in such a way, who say that,","\"I have to bear and I must suffer"]],[1989,["and this is how it happens and who go","on taking the conditioning of all kinds","of things,"]],[1996,["then you develop a super-ego and","the super-ego and ego both are"]],[2001,["on the head and that's how you","become the bird encaged in a","shell of egg."]],[2010,["Now, when this Kundalini rises above","the Agnya, what happens,"]],[2015,["the most marvellous thing happens is","this, that this ascent immediately","pushes the, pushes the"]],[2025,["both these balloon like things into the","Vishuddhi chakra and the whole thing","is sucked in."]],[2030,["I have worked out the Sahastrara in this","lifetime and as you know I also studied"]],[2038,["Medicine and partly this and that, just","to understand what these people","call this and that"]],[2043,["and that's how I can relate it now to the","gross things also. Thank you very much!"]],[2054,["Now if you have any questions like","yesterday, you can ask Me for a while"]],[2058,["and then we'll have the session of","realization for about 10 minutes."]],[2064,["But ask sensible questions."]],[2088,["(क्या कह रहे हैं? सुनाई नहीं दे रहा बहनजी।)","What are you saying? It's not audible,","sister."]],[2091,["Sahaja Yogi: She says that the mark on","the forehead, You said, the red mark"]],[2095,["is very good, but in North India the","widows do not put it."]],[2100,["Shri Mataji: You see this widowhood and","all that we don't believe in it."]],[2103,["No man is a widower, why should","a woman be widow?"]],[2107,["You see it is the mistake of the women,","who accept all these non-sensical","ideas."]],[2112,["In Sahaja yoga we don't allow any","widows to come with that [UNCLEAR]"]],[2117,["Is all non-sensical ideas given to us","about women. Women are so respected."]],[2123,["Are to be respected because they're","shaktis. They're Shaktipeethas."]],[2127,["But we the women, have made us","ourselves like that. What was the need","to be subdued to that?"]],[2134,["We have lost the capacity to be a","woman now. A woman is like this","Mother Earth."]],[2140,["She can bear lots of things about","herself but not nonsense."]],[2146,["This 'Widhwa' and all those things, are","all absolutely nonsensical things"]],[2151,["and Sahaja yogies don't believe in","all that."]],[2154,["Between the two somebody has to die","earlier. Both can't die together."]],[2159,["I've not known anybody, both of","husband and wife dying together on the"]],[2163,["same time, same spot. One will become","a widower or a widow."]],[2170,["Is only suppression of women","which has come to us from"]],[2174,["various sources and we have accepted","them."]],[2180,["North India, you don't tell Me about","North India. In North India even married","women don't put."]],[2186,["They want to move like widows."]],[2191,["[UNCLEAR] they don't put. I've seen,","I mean, it's not"]],[2194,["[UNCLEAR] not to an unmarried,","and a widow will not [UNCLEAR]"]],[2199,["They had no mark, nothing. They don't","understand the value of all this."]],[2203,["They're about to become like","Westernized people or Islamic - I don't","know what sort of a conditioning."]],[2212,["Seeker: I have some question from here.","Shri Mataji: [What is he saying?] क्या कह रहे हैं?>"]],[2221,["आइए सरदारजी, आइए। आप कुछ (अस्पष्ट)","[Come sardarji, come. You were","[UNCLEAR"]],[2229,["मुझे तो आजकल डर लगने लग गया है।","[I have started feeling scared these days.]"]],[2235,["कहिए"]],[2242,["हाँ यहीं बता दीजिए , यहीं से बता दीजिए,","वह बता देंगे। [Yes tell over there, tell him","there, he will tell.]"]],[2244,["इन से बता दीजिए, ये लोग बता देंगे।","[Tell them, these people will tell.]"]],[2246,["Seeker: I take it that You believe","that all religions are good."]],[2251,["Shri Mataji: All religions?","Seeker: Are good"]],[2253,["Shri Mataji: Good - they're the best.","Seeker: Right."]],[2256,["Now, if one had a child and one were to","advise him and give a freedom of him"]],[2261,["to choose any religion to follow, which","religion would You advise should be","advocated to the child?"]],[2266,["Shri Mataji: Sahaja Yoga"]],[2275,["In Sahaja yoga you get all religions.","What, what Nanak Sahab has said,","\"Sahaj samadhi lago\""]],[2282,["Sahaj samadhi! You have to get your","samadhi, you have to become a Spirit,"]],[2286,["the time has come for that. There's no","need to have so many religions."]],[2290,["All religions are respected within","yourself because they all reside","within you."]],[2294,["You do not know how important every","religion is to us. Is extremely","important."]],[2300,["We do not know the essence of all the","religions. We're just outside, that's why."]],[2304,["So, the child should be called a Sahaja","Yogi, who is dharmateet, who is","gunateet, who is kalateet."]],[2313,["[An Auliya does not have any caste.","This leads to quarrels.]","औलिया की कोई जात नहीं होती। इनसे","झगडे खड़े होते हैं।"]],[2327,["Question: What is Your view about","rebirth in different animal forms?"]],[2332,["Shri Mataji: Rebirth in different?","Sahaj yogi: In different animal forms."]],[2336,["Sahaja Yogi: How after man dies he will","be born as an animal or as a","human being."]],[2342,["Seeker: Life after death.","Shri Mataji: Now why are you worried","about death, I'm talking about life."]],[2348,["This is a typical Indian mind, I tell you.","[UNCLEAR]"]],[2352,["First of all they'll come and ask,","\"Mother, was I anything in last life?\""]],[2358,["\"Then , what was I?\" I said, \"Baba, why","are you worried? To Me you are My son,","you better get your realization.\""]],[2366,["We have to be in the present. We have","to be in the present. Once it's finished,","then future doesn't exist."]],[2374,["We have to be in the present."]],[2380,["Question: Is 'prakriti' and 'purusha' one?"]],[2383,["Shri Mataji: Of course. It's like moon","and moonlight, sun and sunlight."]],[2392,["But when the Prakriti creates, the","Purusha watches."]],[2415,["Question: Inspite of my efforts for the","last few days, I have not had been","inception of my kundalini."]],[2421,["Can I have Your touch to clear my","chakras?"]],[2426,["Shri Mataji: Alright. When you'll come","down you will have this. I'll work hard","for that. We'll work it out."]],[2433,["Question: It is extremely typical to","become a lady saint. Please comment."]],[2441,["Shri Mataji: I mean, I'm not a saint,","I'm a Mother, that's all."]],[2444,["It's very easy for Me to become the","Mother. If your Kundalini is the Mother,","I'm also a Mother."]],[2453,["Is the easiest thing to be a Mother. I do","not claim to be a saint or anything","like that."]],[2458,["But lady is always a sage so she","cannot become a sanyasi."]],[2465,["A woman's position is like that."]],[2471,["A mother, who looks after the child,","gives all her attention to the child,"]],[2475,["is already in saintlihood actually. But","we Indians, we think that only men","can become saints;"]],[2482,["Naturally, those who are not, have to","become saints."]],[2496,["Question: Can ladies chant the","Gayatri Mantra?"]],[2500,["Shri Mataji: Haan. No one should chant","without understanding."]],[2504,["Now, Gayatri mantra is to be chanted","by people who are depressed in life,"]],[2510,["who feel nervous in life, who are","left-sided. So ladies, some of the","ladies have to do."]],[2517,["And those men who are like that, also","have to do. But those who are already"]],[2521,["riding a high horse, should stop","chanting Gayatri mantra."]],[2532,["Question: My son is suffering from","asthma. What should I do? He is","ten years old."]],[2538,["Shri Mataji: Alright. Certainly Sahaja","Yoga can cure to a child. You have to"]],[2542,["come to our center and they will","tell you what is to be done."]],[2546,["All the individual questions should be","sorted out in the center individually."]],[2551,["We can pay attention individually. We","have doctors here, we have other","people, they can look after you."]],[2560,["Question: Is it the mother which we,","which has no beginning and end.","Therefore, how we call it?"]],[2570,["Shri Mataji: Is it the mother?"]],[2571,["Sahaja Yogi: Is it the mother which has","no beginning and end therefore,","how we call it?"]],[2576,["Shri Mataji: Mother, that's all. Mother","is [UNCLEAR]"]],[2585,["Question: I have been feeling","intoxicated since two days, something","different. What is this feeling?"]],[2592,["श्री माताजी: जब मस्त हुए फिर क्या बोलें ?","[Shri Mataji: What can I say when I'm","in ecstasy!]"]],[2602,["Question: A chandan has been","recreated for the forehead which","is white and not red"]],[2612,["Shri Mataji: There are two types of","chandanas - white and the red"]],[2617,["and the red is to be used for people","who are left-sided, depressive"]],[2621,["but people who are aggressive, are","people who are right-sided. They have","to use white chandanas."]],[2628,["Question: Can You throw light for","what are we born?"]],[2632,["Shri Mataji: We are born to be innocent."]],[2635,["We are born to be the citizens of God","[UNCLEAR]"]],[2640,["To enter into His Kingdom, to enjoy all","these blessings and glories."]],[2645,["Like a very gracious Father, He's invited","you and He wants to grant all that is","possible for His children."]],[2660,["Sahaja Yogi: On behalf of all the Delhi","Sahaja yogies, we cordially invite you"]],[2665,["to celebrate Shri Mataji's birthday on","the 20th. It is a great honor that"]],[2671,["Shri Mataji has agreed to stay this extra","few days so that we are able to"]],[2677,["be present for this auspicious occasion.","You're all invited and we hope"]],[2683,["that you will all come and bring others","also to celebrate and make this a","great success. Thank You!"]],[2689,["Now Shri Mataji will give realization.","[APPLAUSE]"]],[2722,["Question: Mother, You have told about","Kundalini jagran but how can it","be achieved?"]],[2728,["I want a practical of this.","Shri Mataji: Alright, we'll have it now.","Practical"]],[2737,["Now the people who are standing,","can sit down, can come forward","and sit down."]],[2742,["Everybody should sit down. You'll be","seated, comfortably."]],[2750,["Please be seated comfortably."]],[2771,["पहाड़ की जैसी कुण्डलिनी उठानी पड़ती है - करें क्या ? हाँ।","[Kundalini, similar to a mountain, has to","be lifted, what to do? Yes.]"]],[2784,["It's a very simple process. As I told you","that we have Sympathetic endings"]],[2790,["on these five fingers, six and seven","centers on the left and same way, five,","six and seven centers."]],[2798,["Now when you put your hands like this,","the chaitanya goes, passes through"]],[2808,["your Sympathetic nerve endings and","informs, as I told you, Shri Ganesha","on the Muladhara."]],[2817,["As a result of that Kundalini ascends.","For that, is very simple,"]],[2826,["you have a cooperate with Me a little","bit and it will work out."]],[2830,["It can work out on anyone. There's no","age problem, no problem at all."]],[2837,["It works out very easily. Now first of","all, take out your shoes -"]],[2841,["is the help because this Mother Earth is","the one, which is represented within us"]],[2846,["in the Sacrum bone as Kundalini.","Please take out your shoes and put your","hands towards Me."]],[2861,["Now try to follow what I tell you. Is very,","very simple but try to follow. Is very","simple."]],[2870,["That first of all, you have to thank your","Mother Earth or this yog bhumi of India"]],[2878,["for giving you birth in this great country","and that request Her that She will bless","you at this time of your realization."]],[2888,["So, with complete heart in that prayer,","you ask Her blessings three times."]],[2899,["तीन बार अपनी मातृभूमि के प्रति श्रद्धांजलि अर्पित","करते हुए आप उनसे आशीर्वाद माँगें कि,"]],[2909,["\"हे माँ इस समय जब कि हमारा मोक्ष का क्षण","है, आप हमें आशीर्वादित करिए।\""]],[2917,["ऐसे तीन बार कहें - पूर्ण ह्रदय से।"]],[2934,["अब सीधी बात और एक है, कि हमें अपने अंदर","बसा हुआ इनोसेंस(अबोधिता) जो है,"]],[2941,["जो कि श्री गणेश के रूप में है, उससे संरक्षण","माँगना होगा। इससे ये कहें कि,"]],[2949,["\"हे गणेश, हे श्री गणेश, आप इस मोक्ष क्षण","में हमारा संरक्षण करिए।\" तीन बार कहें।"]],[2957,["Please request Shri Ganesha as a prayer","offered to Him that, \"O Shri Ganesha,"]],[2964,["at this time of our ascent, please","protect me.\" Say it thrice."]],[2984,["Now put your left hand on your lap","comfortably. Left hand represents","the Ichcha shakti,"]],[2995,["the power of desire that your desire is","of your self-realization and the right","hand on your heart."]],[3003,["The right hand represents your kriya","shakti, is the power of action."]],[3009,["So left hand should be comfortably","placed on your lap."]],[3014,["अपने गोद में लेफ्ट हैंड आप आराम से रख","लीजिए। इससे इच्छा शक्ति प्रदर्शित होगी।"]],[3023,["और राइट हैंड अपने ह्रदय पे रख लें।","इस ह्रदय में आत्मा का वास है।"]],[3031,["और राइट हैंड जो है वो क्रिया शक्ति","प्रदर्शित कर रहा है।"]],[3038,["ह्रदय पे रख कर के आप पूर्ण विश्वास से एक","सवाल पूछें, मन में पूछें कि, \"माँ क्या मैं आत्मा हूँ?\""]],[3049,["बहुत से लोग जो पहले से आ रहे हैं, उनको","आलरेडी हाथ में ठंडक हवा आ रही है।"]],[3056,["लेकिन तो भी मैं कहूँगी कि सब लोग पैर ज़मीन","पर रखें तो अच्छा रहेगा, क्योंकि माँ की","बड़ी मदद होती है इसमें।"]],[3066,["\"क्या मैं आत्मा हूँ। माँ, क्या मैं आत्मा हूँ?\""]],[3073,["Now ask the question in your heart,","\"Mother, am I the Spirit?\""]],[3079,["Please ask this question thrice. This is","just to clear your mind about it."]],[3089,["It's like a port of a computer.","When you ask the question to the","computer, the answer comes."]],[3097,["So, ask the question. For people who","suffer from over-active heart"]],[3109,["and all the consequent diseases out of","that should always use this as a mantra","saying, \"Mother, I am the Spirit.\""]],[3121,["Now put this right hand on the stomach","on the left hand side."]],[3127,["Now here the chakra of guru tatwa","works up. The guru tatwa,"]],[3136,["the principle of guru within you works","out on the left hand side of your","stomach."]],[3141,["As you are the Spirit, you have to be","your own guru. So you have to say,"]],[3148,["\"Mother, am I my own guru?\""]],[3152,["अब राइट हैंड अपने पेट पर आप लेफ्ट","साइड में रख लीजिए।"]],[3159,["और इसके बाद आप ये सवाल पूछिए कि,","\"माँ क्या मैं स्वयं का गुरु हूँ?\""]],[3166,["क्योंकि ये गुरु तत्व का सेंटर है, उसका केंद्र है;","और क्योंकि आपने पहला सवाल पूछा था,","कि क्या आप आत्मा हैं।"]],[3176,["आपने उसी के क्रमुक आपने जो दूसरा सवाल है","वो पूछा कि, \"माँ क्या मैं स्वयं का गुरु हूँ?\"","ये तीन बार पूछिए।"]],[3191,["इसके पूछने के बाद आप इस राइट हैंड को फिर","नीचे की तरफ ले जाएँ। पेट पर नीचे की","तरफ रखें।"]],[3200,["इस जगह जो स्वाधिष्ठान चक्र है, जो स्वाधिष्ठान चक्र","है, वो यहाँ पर शुद्ध विद्या प्रदान करता है,","आपको शुद्ध विद्या देता है।"]],[3212,["शुद्ध विद्या वो विद्या है जिससे आप परमात्मा का","दिया हुआ ये जो आशीर्वाद है,"]],[3219,["जो आपका आत्मसाक्षात्कार है, उसे आप प्लावित","कर सकते हैं, उसे आप इस्तेमाल कर सकते हैं।"]],[3230,["आप ये जान सकते हैं कि परमात्मा के","कायदे-कानून क्या हैं।"]],[3233,["इसी एक शुद्ध विद्या से ही आप सारा परमात्मा के","बारे में सारा ज्ञान प्राप्त कर सकते हैं।"]],[3239,["शुद्ध विद्या माने वो तकनीक, वो तंत्र जिससे आप","ये जान लें कि परमात्मा की शक्ति क्या है"]],[3248,["और उसे किस तरह से इस्तेमाल करना चाहिए।","इसीलिए इसे शुद्ध विद्या कहते हैं।"]],[3252,["क्योंकि बिल्कुल ये अब्सोल्यूट है, एकांकी","है, इससे दूसरा कोई उसका पर्याय नहीं है -","पर्याय रहित।"]],[3260,["Putting your hand on the lower side of","the abdomen, you have to say,"]],[3269,["\"Mother, please give me Pure","Knowledge, Shuddh Vidya.\""]],[3275,["Shuddh Vidya means the","Pure Knowledge, means the knowledge"]],[3280,["about all the laws and regulations of","God's energy, all the technique of","handling that energy"]],[3290,["and all the knowledge about the","Spirit - is the Shuddh Vidya,"]],[3296,["so please ask six times, \"Mother, give","me Shuddh Vidya, give me","Pure Knowledge.\""]],[3302,["आप भी कहें, \"कृपया माँ मुझे शुद्ध विद्या दीजिए,\"","छह बार।"]],[3307,["ये आपके माँगे बगैर मैं ज़बरदस्ती नहीं","कर सकती।"]],[3310,["I cannot force it on you because you","are independent."]],[3314,["आप स्वतंत्र हैं। आप जब तक इसे माँगेगे","नहीं, मैं ये दे नहीं सकती, सो कहिए,","\"माँ मुझे आप शुद्ध विद्या दीजिए।\""]],[3344,["छह बार कहिए क्योंकि इसके छह,","इसकी छह कलियाँ हैं।"]],[3350,["इस चक्र की छह कलियाँ हैं इसलिए इसे","छह बार कहिए।"]],[3362,["अब इसके बाद हम लोगों को अपनी कुण्डलिनी","पर प्रभाव डाल सकते हैं"]],[3368,["और अलग अलग एक एक चक्र को खोलते हुए","हम ऊपर जा सकते हैं। सब काम","लेफ्ट साइड में होगा।"]],[3373,["You have to now work on the left hand","side and now you can control the","Kundalini's ascent."]],[3379,["So you start now to the next chakra on","the stomach on the left hand side","of the Guru tatwa."]],[3388,["At this point, with full confidence, you","please say that, \"Mother I am my","own master, I am my own guru.\""]],[3409,["Say that ten times for there are ten","principles of guru."]],[3417,["Now put the full attention onto it."]],[3423,["दस मर्तबा आप कहिए पूर्ण विश्वास के साथ","कि, \"माँ, मैं स्वयं का गुरु हूँ।\""]],[3429,["इस वक्त आप अपना हाथ गुरु तत्व के चक्र पे","रखें, जो कि लेफ्ट हैंड आपने लेफ्ट साइड में","पेट पर ऊपर की ओर रखा हुआ है।"]],[3446,["अब इस हाथ को आप ह्रदय पर ले जाएँ।","Take this hand to your heart, please."]],[3456,["ह्रदय पर ले जा कर के, यहाँ पर आपको पूर्ण","विश्वास से अब कहना होगा कि, \"माँ, मैं आत्मा हूँ।\""]],[3464,["Please put your hand on the heart and","say with full assertion and full faith in","yourself that, \"Mother, I am the Spirit.\""]],[3474,["Please say this twelve times because","this centre has got twelve petals."]],[3482,["बारह मर्तबा आप कहिए कि, \"माँ मैं आत्मा हूँ।\""]],[3498,["अब बारह मर्तबा पूरे मन से कहें।"]],[3506,["आप अगर आत्मा हैं तो आप निर्दोष हैं। बहुत","से लोग अपने तो बहुत दोषमय समझते हैं।"]],[3516,["हर समय दोष अपने निकालते रहते हैं अपने","को नीचे गिराते हैं और कहते हैं कि, \"मैंने","ये दोष किया वो दोष किया।\""]],[3522,["इससे आपकी लेफ्ट नाभि पकड़ जाती है","जिससे एनजाइना जैसी बीमारियाँ होतीं हैं।"]],[3526,["इसलिए अब आप अपना हाथ उठा करके","लेफ्ट विशुद्धि पर रखें सामने की तरफ से"]],[3533,["यहाँ पर जहाँ पर कि आपका कन्धा","और गर्दन मिलते हैं।"]],[3537,["ज़ोर से वहाँ पकड़ें, उँगलियाँ पीछे की ओर","ले जाएँऔर ज़ोर से पकड़ कर के खींचें।"]],[3545,["इस जगह आपको ये कहना चाहिए सोलह मर्तबा","क्योंकि श्री कृष्ण का ये लेफ्ट साइड है"]],[3551,["कि, \"माँ, मैं आत्मा हूँ और मैं निर्दोष हूँ।\"","पूरे विश्वास के साथ कहिए। सोलह मर्तबा।"]],[3562,["पूरा विश्वास रखिए क्योंकि परमात्मा जो है","वो प्रेम का सागर है, आनंद का सागर है,"]],[3568,["दया का सागर है, पर सबसे अधिक वो क्षमा का","सागर है। वो क्षमा का सागर है - रेहमत, रहीम।"]],[3581,["हाँ! सोलह मर्तबा कहें।"]],[3593,["Please say it sixteen times that,","\"Mother, I am the Spirit and I'm","not guilty.\""]],[3600,["Please say it sixteen times, \"Mother,","I am the Spirit and I'm not guilty.\""]],[3633,["Now, raise this right hand onto your","forehead across. Now here is the","Agnya chakra."]],[3643,["Press your forehead. Now say,","\"Mother, I forgive everyone.\""]],[3650,["While saying this you must remember,","first of all you must forgive yourself."]],[3656,["You say, \"Mother, I forgive everyone,","I forgive everyone.\""]],[3663,["इस हाथ को ऊपर उठा करके अपने भाल प्रदेश","पर संभाल रखें। संभाल - पूरी तरह से पकड़ के।"]],[3674,["अपना हाथ सर पे माथे पर इस तरह से रखें","जैसे आड़ा और उसको दबा कर"]],[3679,["माथे को पकड़ें और इस जगह आप कहें","कि, \"माँ, मैंने सब को क्षमा कर दी है।\""]],[3684,["बहुत से लोग कहते हैं कि, \"माँ क्षमा करना बहुत","कठिन है,\" लेकिन अगर आप क्षमा नहीं कर रहे हैं,"]],[3689,["तो आप अपने को ही तो तकलीफ दे रहें हैं। ये","समझ लेना चाहिए, इसलिए कृपया कहिए कि,","\"माँ, मैंने सब को क्षमा कर दी है।\""]],[3704,["अब ये हाथ आप पीछे की ओर ले जाएँ,","जो सर को पकड़ लीजिए पीछे से।"]],[3709,["पीछे में जो हिस्सा बाहर की ओर काफी निकला","हुआ रहता है, उसे आप पकड़ लें।"]],[3717,["Please put your hand on the backside","of your head and try to hold it","very tight."]],[3725,["अब आप निर्दोष हैं, बिल्कुल निर्दोष हैं","लेकिन आपको ये कहना होगा कि,"]],[3731,["\"मुझसे अगर कोई गलती हो गयी हो, तो परमात्मा","मुझे क्षमा करें।\" ऐसे तीन बार कहें।"]],[3736,["आप हालाँकि निर्दोष हैं, उसमें कोई दोष नहीं, पर","अगर कोई गलती हो गई हो तो उसे क्षमा कर दें।"]],[3748,["पूर्ण ह्रदय से कहें। नतमस्तक होकर के नम्र","भाव से कहें।"]],[3752,["Now you have to say when you put","your hand on the back that,"]],[3756,["\"Please forgive me if I have done any","mistakes,\" to God."]],[3761,["To God Almighty you have to ask for","forgiveness, but you are not guilty,"]],[3765,["you're not guilty. Don't feel guilty about","it. Just say that without feeling guilty."]],[3778,["Now, on top of the head, put your","hand, right hand on top of your head,"]],[3783,["on the fontanel bone area and press it","with palm and move it in a","clockwise manner."]],[3789,["अब अपने तालू पर अपना हाथ रखें।","हाथ का मतलब ये है कि हथेली"]],[3797,["और उसको आप इस तरह से दबाइए और","घुमाइए जैसे कि घडी के काँटे घूमते हैं।"]],[3805,["इसको घुमाते वक्त यहाँ सात चक्र हैं, जिसके","बारे में मैं बताऊँगी परसों आपसे, जो सहस्त्रार है।"]],[3811,["इस सात चक्रों के लिए आप सात बार कहिए कि,","\"माँ मुझे आत्मसाक्षात्कार दीजिए।\""]],[3819,["यहाँ पर भी मैं रुक जातीं हूँ, क्योंकि मेरी ऐसी कोई","इच्छा नहीं कि आपकी स्वतंत्रता को लाँघ जाऊँ।"]],[3827,["जो आदमी स्वयं स्वतंत्र नहीं है, वो परमात्मा का तंत्र","नहीं जान सकता और वो पूरी स्वतंत्रता भी","उपभोग नहीं कर सकता।"]],[3834,["इसलिए पूर्ण स्वतंत्रता में आपको कहना चाहिए","कि, \"माँ मुझे आप यहाँ पर आत्मसाक्षातकार","दीजिए।\""]],[3844,["Please ask for your Self-realization.","I cannot cross your freedom"]],[3851,["so you have to ask for it, \"Mother please","give me Self-realization.\""]],[3855,["Please say it seven times while moving","your hand in the clockwise manner."]],[3862,["[Shri Mataji blows into the mic]"]],[3867,["[Shri Mataji blows into the mic]"]],[3871,["[Shri Mataji blows into the mic]"]],[3876,["[Shri Mataji blows into the mic]"]],[3881,["[Shri Mataji blows into the mic]"]],[3885,["[Shri Mataji blows into the mic]"]],[3889,["[Shri Mataji blows into the mic]"]],[3896,["Now put your hands together like this.","Don't think, don't think."]],[3902,["Now put your left hand on top of your","head and see if you are, on top"]],[3907,["अधांत्री, सर के ऊपर, अधांत्री रखिए।"]],[3910,["and just see by pressing near the","fontanel bone area, moving, if you are","getting a cool breeze in the head."]],[3923,["Is it flowing? Just try."]],[3928,["ऊपर मत रखिए। जो लोग आज ही आये हैं,","उनको शायद नहीं महसूस हो लेकिन","अधिकतर लोगों को होगा।"]],[3934,["ज़रा सा ऊपर। अब दूसरा हाथ करके देखें।","हाँ! देखिये, आराम से।"]],[3948,["सूक्ष्म है, बहुत सूक्ष्म है।","It's very subtle."]],[3950,["बहुत सटल है। इसलिए आँख बंद करके चित्त यहाँ","लाएँ। इस जगह और देखें, आ रहा है क्या","ठंडा-ठंडा ? सोचिए नहीं।"]],[3957,["Hmm, it's coming."]],[3963,["Sahaja yogi: They're thinking about it."]],[3965,["श्री माताजी: इसके बारे में सोचिए नहीं, निर्विचार","रहें। आप निर्विचार स्थिति में जा सकते हैं अब।"]],[3969,["क्योंकि आज्ञा चक्र को लाँघ गई कुण्डलिनी।","आप निर्विचारिता में देखें।"]],[3973,["मेरी ओर देखें और निर्विचार रहें। निर्विचार रह","कर के आप यहाँ चित्त रखें।"]],[3978,["चित्त यहाँ रखें और देखिए। विचार नहीं करिए।","हम्म! ठीक है?"]],[3990,["अब दोनों हाथ ऊपर करें इस तरह से और एक","सवाल पूछिए अपने मन में कि, \"क्या माँ","ये ब्रह्म शक्ति है?\""]],[4001,["मन में पूछें, \"क्या ये ब्रह्मशक्ति है जो","सारा जीवंत कार्य करती है?\""]],[4006,["Please ask the question, \"Mother, is this","the living power of living God, which","does all the living work?\""]],[4017,["तीन बार पूछिए निर्विचार में। हाँ! अब दोनों हाथ","सामने करके देखिए। आ रही ठंडक हाथ मैं?","आ रही है?"]],[4033,["साधक: हाँ जी आ रही है।"]],[4036,["श्री माताजी: किसी-किसी के लेफ्ट हैंड में आएगी,","किसी-किसी के राइट हैंड में, क्योंकि","संतुलन नहीं होता है।"]],[4042,["इसलिए जिसको लेफ्ट हैंड में आ रही है, वो राइट","हैंड हमारी ओर करें।"]],[4046,["राइट हैंड हमारी ओर करें और पेट पे अपना हाथ","रखें। थोड़ी देर में राइट हैंड में आने लग जाएगी"]],[4056,["जिनके लेफ्ट हैंड में नहीं आती, वो लेफ्ट हैंड","हमारी ओर करें और राइट हैंड ह्रदय पे रखें।","लेफ्ट हैंड करें।"]],[4075,["अब आपको इतना बताना है कि आप अपनी","कुण्डलिनी किस तरह से जागृत खुद कर सकते हैं"]],[4080,["और उसको मेन्टेन कर सकते हैं और इसके","अलावा आपको सेण्टर पर आना होगा"]],[4085,["क्योंकि सहज योग जो है, ये सामूहिक चेतना","का कार्य है, ये विराट का कार्य है।"]],[4091,["ये इसे कि मैक्रोकोस्म का माइक्रोकस्म से सम्बन्ध","जोड़ना है। इसके लिए सामूहिक तरीके से होता है।"]],[4098,["अगर घर में आप बैठें और कहें कि, \"माँ मैं","करता था और सब खो गया,\" सो फिर मैं","सुनने नहीं वाली।"]],[4103,["आप लोग सेण्टर में आइए, इसे प्राप्त करें और","उसमें गहरे उतरें। 'जिन खोजा तिन पाइयाँ'"]],[4109,["ऊपरी तरीके के लोगों के लिए सहज योग नहीं है।","जो गहनता से उतरना चाहते हैं, उन्हीं के लिए","सहज योग है।"]],[4117,["रामदास स्वामी ने कहा है, 'एड़िया गबाडया ते","काम नोहे।' ऐसे वैसे लोगों का ये काम नहीं है।"]],[4126,["अब आख़री बार मैं आपको बता देती हूँ कि किस","तरह से अपने कुण्डलिनी का जागरण आप","ख़ुद कर सकते हैं।"]],[4132,["पहले तो आपको अपने को बंधन देना होगा, जिसे","कि कवच कहते हैं, या कहिए माँ का आँचल,","जिससे संरक्षण हो किसी भी दुष्ट प्रवृत्ति से।"]],[4140,["तो लेफ्ट हैंड हमारी ओर करें और राइट हैंड","उठा कर के अपने सर पर से इस तरह","से बंधन लिया जाता है।"]],[4148,["एक, फिर नीचे ये पहले चक्र के लिए , फिर दूसरा","सर पर से लीजिएगा - इसका पूरा अर्थ आपको","बता देंगे"]],[4158,["फिर तीसरे चक्र पे, फिर चौथे चक्र पे, फिर पाँचवे","चक्र पे, फिर छटे चक्र पे, और फिर सातवे चक्र पे।"]],[4181,["इस तरह से आपने पहले अपने को बंधन में ले","लिया। उसके बाद कुण्डलिनी के सामने इस","तरह से लेफ्ट हैंड रखा जाता है।"]],[4189,["लेफ्ट हैंड - मैं भी इंटोक्सिकेटेड हो गयीं हूँ","आजकल।"]],[4193,["लेफ्ट हैंड रखिए। और राइट हैंड जो है उसको इस","तरह से घुमाना चाहिए कि ऊपर, सामने,","नीचे, पीछे। इस तरह से कायदे से।"]],[4204,["देखिये, अब इस तरह से कुण्डलिनी उठाई","जाती है; ये हाथ सीधा चलता है और ये","राइट हैंड उस पर ऐसा घूमता है।"]],[4210,["लेफ्ट हैंड की तरफ चित्त रहे और राइट हैंड से","उठाइये। ऊपर की ओर - उठाइये,","उठाइये, उठाइये।"]],[4218,["अब कन्धों को ढ़ीला छोड़ के, सर को ढ़ीला","छोड़ के, एक बंधन (अस्पष्ट - व्यष्टन) दीजिए।","बाँध दीजिए।"]],[4225,["अब फिर से, फिर से ऊपर, फिर से ऊपर- दो।","तीसरे मर्तबा - तीन। तीन मर्तबा बाँधें।"]],[4257,["[ ASIDE - राइट स्वाधिष्ठान बहुत है -","too much right side]"]],[4261,["देखिए अब हाथ में आ रहा है कि नहीं ठंडा।","दिल्ली में राइट स्वाधिष्ठान बहुत है।"]],[4267,["उसका कारण ये है कि बहुत आदमी सोचते हैं,","प्लानिंग करते है, जो बिल्कुल बेकार है।"]],[4271,["दिमाग अपना आगे दौड़ाते रहते हैं। अब जैसे","बैठे-बैठे लोग सोच रहे हैं"]],[4274,["कि अब कौन सी बस मिलेगी, कौन सी ट्रैन","मिलेगी, कैसे जाएँगे, क्या करें।"]],[4280,["इस वक्त आप यहाँ बैठे हैं। एक क्षण भर","के लिए आप वर्तमान में आइए।"]],[4290,["हाँ! आ रही ठंडक सी हाथ में? विचार नहीं करना।","विचार से परे, निर्विचारिता के परे।"]],[4302,["[ASIDE - It's better. Right Swadhishthan.]"]],[4309,["राइट स्वाधिस्ठान अगर बहुत चल रहा हो, तो","आपको लेफ्ट से उठाकर राइट में छोड़ना","चाहिए तीन बार।"]],[4315,["एक, दो और तीन। जितने भी बड़े-बड़े सोचने वाले","लोग हैं ऐसा करिए - एक, दो और तीन।"]],[4327,["राइट स्वाधिष्ठान जिनका चलता है उनको","डायबिटीज की बीमारी हो सकती है,"]],[4331,["लिवर की बीमारी हो सकती है, किडनी की बीमारी","हो सकती है, लुकेमिया हो सकता है और उन लोगों को"]],[4343,["हाई ब्लड प्रेशर हो सकता है, किडनी ट्रबल हो","सकता है, और ये सब नहीं हुआ तो उनको","हार्ट ट्रबल हो सकता है।"]],[4351,["साइटिका हो सकता है राइट साइड का। हाँ! और","नींद नहीं आती है ऐसे लोगों को, सो नहीं","सकते रात में।"]],[4364,["हाँ, ठीक है अब हालत? कुछ पैसे भी मूड ठीक","करते हैं। सोचिए मत, सोचिए मत -","क्या सोचना है?"]],[4377,["बगैर सोचे ही सब जाना जाता है, निर्विचार में।"]],[4381,["हाँ! सब को क्षमा कर दीजिए, सब को","क्षमा कर दीजिए।"]],[4392,["सब को क्षमा करिए आज्ञा चक्र पे आ गई है। हाँ !"]],[4402,["[ASIDE -If it sucks in. Better?","Sahaja Yogi: Yes.]"]],[4413,["Shri Mataji: Hmm, it's sucked."]],[4420,["बोझा जो है बेकार सब लोग लिए हुए हैं।","जैसे कि किसी देहाती से कहा गया"]],[4425,["कि, \"तुम प्लेन में जाते वक्त इतना बोझा मत ले","जाओ,\" तो अपने सर पर ले कर बैठ गया।"]],[4431,["इसी प्रकार आप भी बोझा लिए सर पे बैठे हैं।","करने-धरने वाले तो सब दूसरे ही हैं।"]],[4437,["हाँ! करता और भोक्ता दूसरे ही हैं।","आप बेकार में ही परेशान हैं।"]],[4444,["आ रही हाथ में ठंडक? कितने लोगों के हाथ में","ठंडक आ रही है?"]],[4450,["हाथ में या सर में? हाथ ऊपर उठाएँ - दोनों हाथ।"]],[4457,["अधिक लोगों के आ गई है - अधिकतर।","सरदारजीयों के पहले आनी चाहिए।"]],[4468,["निराकार की बात जिसने की उसको पहले","वाईब्रेशन्स मिलना चाहिए।"]],[4473,["ठीक है।","[APPLAUSE]"]],[4493,["सहज योगी: आप सब लोग बैठे रहें अभी आगे","कोई न आये। थोड़ी देर में श्री माताजी","जायेंगीं, फिर आप।"]],[4499,["जिन लोगों को देखना है, स्टेज पर आ जाएँगे,","सहज योगी देख लेंगे।आप बैठे रहिए आराम से।"]],[4554,["सहज योगी: कृपया जो लोग आज ही आये हैं, वो","श्री माताजी का फोटो ले लें, ताकि फोटो से ही"]]]);
